        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Scorpio &mdash; 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p><em>One needle, placed exactly. You will place fourteen more.</em></p><p>The target must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> It gains one <strong>needle</strong> and takes @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and it is off-guard for 1 round.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The persistent bleed damage increases by 1d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
